## 🎯 Overview

This project implements a robust SMS spam classifier using natural language processing (NLP) and machine learning techniques. The system can automatically detect spam messages with high accuracy, helping users filter unwanted messages.

### Key Capabilities

- **Text Preprocessing**: Cleans and normalizes raw text data
- **Feature Extraction**: Converts text to numerical features using TF-IDF
- **Multiple Models**: Implements 3 different classification algorithms
- **Comprehensive Evaluation**: Provides detailed performance metrics
- **Real-time Prediction**: Can classify new messages instantly

## ✨ Features

### Text Preprocessing
- ✅ Converts text to lowercase
- ✅ Removes punctuation and special characters
- ✅ Eliminates stop words
- ✅ Applies stemming or lemmatization
- ✅ Handles numbers and whitespace

### Machine Learning
- 🤖 **Naive Bayes** - Fast and effective for text classification
- 🤖 **Logistic Regression** - Reliable linear classifier
- 🤖 **Support Vector Machine** - Powerful for high-dimensional data

### Evaluation Metrics
- 📊 Accuracy
- 📊 Precision
- 📊 Recall
- 📊 F1-Score
- 📊 Confusion Matrix
- 📊 Model Comparison Charts

### User-Friendly
- 🚀 Simple prediction function
- 💬 Custom message testing
- 📈 Visual results
- 🔍 Confidence scores

